   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Chat**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Chat & Tuning**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Chat & Tuning**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Comin' Through**: back after 25 archived shows (2360 days) [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **twod2024-10-03.MATRIX.24bit** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 13 songs; 72 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Jess Wolfe and Holly Laessig from Lucius joined as backing vocalists [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **twod2024-10-03.MATRIX.24bit**: taped by yltfan; transferred by Dennis Orr; source: AT4051 (cardioids) > Tascam DR-680 (with Busman mod) @ 24 bit/48 kHz + Beyerdynamic MEM86 (shotguns) > Tascam DR-680 (with Busman mod) @ 24 bit/48 kHz [1]. Also: Files processed in iZotope RX11, Adobe Audition, and Sound Forge Pro before FLAC conversion [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Brutifulstore.com: [The War On Drugs Oct 3 2024 Live At Moda Center, Portland OR Band Event T Shirt](https://brutifulstore.com/product/the-war-on-drugs-oct-3-2024-live-at-moda-center-portland-or-band-event-t-shirt/) [3]",
